  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan soul searches Jun Shen Guang and learns that Central Continent’s Four Xunzi are time path Gu Immortals, quadruplets found young by Spirit Butterfly Valley and specially nurtured: three older brothers and one younger sister, Shang Xunzi, Zhong Xunzi, Xia Xunzi, and Xun Guo Zi. The novel spelling is Zhong Xunzi.",
      "chapters": [
        1628
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_shang_xunzi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "char_xia_xunzi",
        "char_xun_guo_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jun Shen Guang’s information places all Four Xunzi at rank seven with a combination technique that can briefly contest a rank eight. Spirit Butterfly Valley keeps them hidden, and Heavenly Court uses them as the best candidates to control Present and Past Pavilion on the River of Time.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-pavilion-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_present_and_past_pavilion",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During Fang Yuan’s first clash, Zhong Xunzi has a deep gaze and warns that the demon is crafty, so they cannot be careless and should play safe. Fang Yuan still breaks the pavilion; the Four Xunzi are dead or injured and kicked into the river.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-pavilion-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Ye tells Shang Xunzi that two of the siblings have been swept away by the River of Time. Shang Xunzi judges those two already dead, then uses the siblings’ unique revival killer move so that all Four Xunzi soon return uninjured.",
      "chapters": [
        1630
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "revival-after-the-wreck",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Xun Guo Zi dies blocking time cutting edge for Qing Ye, the other three Xunzi look at each other calmly, thinking the sacrifice worth Qing Ye’s favor because they can revive her. Qing Ye then says the revival method will not work this time, and their calm turns to fear.",
      "chapters": [
        1633
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sisters-sacrifice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, Zhong Xunzi is again among the Four Xunzi in Present and Past Pavilion. He looks at Xia Xunzi when Shang Xunzi reports a possible ripple, then consoles his eldest brother not to be too nervous, claiming the Four Xunzi can defeat Fang Yuan even without the pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Myriad Year Flying Warship charges through their waves, Zhong Xunzi shouts to use the pavilion’s strongest move. The sawtooth whirlpool briefly holds the ship before Fang Yuan breaks it and drives toward the pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1805
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sawtooth-whirlpool-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship shatters Present and Past Pavilion. The Four Xunzi fall into the River of Time and are all killed by Fang Yuan shortly afterward.",
      "chapters": [
        1806
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-the-river-of-time",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
